# TypeScript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env*
# Every rule above matches a name *starting* with `.env`. A pulled copy is
# usually named the other way round - `prod.env`, `production.env` - and one of
# those sat untracked in the repo root holding the service-role key until it was
# noticed by eye rather than by a rule.
*.env
